1
00:00:00,564 --> 00:00:01,944
[RAJESH CLEARS THROAT]

2
00:00:02,691 --> 00:00:04,231
(Raj:)Go ahead.

3
00:00:04,401 --> 00:00:05,981
(Man on Screen:)Greetings from Mumbai.

4
00:00:06,153 --> 00:00:08,323
I'm Raj's attorney,
Venkatesh Koothrappali.

5
00:00:08,489 --> 00:00:10,489
(Raj:)Also my cousin.

6
00:00:10,824 --> 00:00:13,494
(Howard:)-You brought a lawyer?
-Don't answer that.

7
00:00:14,411 --> 00:00:15,951
(Venkatesh:)I'll get straight to the point.

8
00:00:16,121 --> 00:00:19,041
(Venkatesh:)My client's prepared to surrender
any interest in the ring...

9
00:00:19,208 --> 00:00:21,668
(Venkatesh:)...in exchange for two Kawasaki Jet Skis.

10
00:00:22,169 --> 00:00:24,669
(Leonard:)We're not giving him two Jet Skis.

11
00:00:24,838 --> 00:00:28,678
(Venkatesh:)Look, we're big boys. Why don't we just
cut to the chase and meet in the middle?

12
00:00:28,842 --> 00:00:31,182
(Venkatesh:)One Kawasaki Jet Ski. Done and done.

13
00:00:34,181 --> 00:00:36,011
(Leonard:)No Jet Skis.

14
00:00:36,809 --> 00:00:38,559
(Venkatesh:)All right, forget the Jet Skis.

15
00:00:38,727 --> 00:00:42,727
Forget the Jet Skis? What happened to
"tear them a new one"?

16
00:00:42,898 --> 00:00:46,608
(Venkatesh:)What can I say?
They played hardball. We lost.

17
00:00:46,777 --> 00:00:49,777
(Raj:)-You're useless.
-I told you that when you hired me.

18
00:00:50,114 --> 00:00:54,324
RAJESH: I'm signing off now.
-Call your mother. She worries.

19
00:00:55,953 --> 00:00:59,023
(Howard:)So you know, if we're bringing
in cousins who are lawyers...

